  triage:title "Retained AN.15 campaign report has no structured campaign_id/final_ci_commit fields" ;
  triage:description "Deliverable 3 requires retaining seed, campaign ID, exact worktree/ref, worker results, minimized candidates, diagnostic codes, and final CI commit. site/reports/fuzz/an15-checked-emission-20260814.json's campaign object has baseline_ref, seed, worktree_path, etc., but no campaign_id key -- only a free-text notes string embedding candidate_ref=8e2d24cc. Confirmed directly via cat. Note: the candidate_ref (8e2d24c) vs reviewed HEAD (9ddf105b) mismatch flagged by arch-qa is NOT a distinct defect -- 9ddf105b is a pure docs-only commit sitting directly on 8e2d24c with no intervening code change (verified via git merge-base --is-ancestor and git log). Only the missing campaign_id/final_ci_commit schema gap is real." ;
